{"id":"n17423-1-9","stage":4,"title":"야유회 · 郊游","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17423-1-9-1","ko":"이번 동아리 야유회는 어디서 한대?","zh":"这次社团野餐会在哪儿举行啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동아리","meaning":"社团，协会","explanation":"동아리：社团，协会","readings":[{"term":"동아리","audio":"/audio/d3841f62249f457a52e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48551","senseId":"1","lemma":"동아리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"야유회는","meaning":"郊游，野游","explanation":"야유회：郊游，野游；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"야유회","audio":"/audio/4c91ff164e2f74372f77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17423","senseId":"1","lemma":"야유회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한대?","meaning":"表示确切的事实。","explanation":"하다：表示确切的事实。；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"29","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"d3841f62249f457a","term":"동아리","zh":"社团，协会","audio":"/audio/d3841f62249f457a52e2.mp3","entryId":"48551","definition":"爱好或意向相同的人们的聚会。","pronunciation":["동아리"]},{"id":"4c91ff164e2f7437","term":"야유회","zh":"郊游，野游","audio":"/audio/4c91ff164e2f74372f77.mp3","entryId":"17423","definition":"为了促进和睦，一起去野外玩的聚会。","pronunciation":["야ː유회","야ː유훼"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/a